{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "death-of-the-crow",
  "name": "Death of the Crow",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Death_of_the_Crow",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-23T09:23:41.138Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Once upon a midnight dreary, while you pondered, weak and weary,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Over many a quaint and curious volume of forgotten dreams —"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "While you nodded, nearly napping, suddenly there came a tapping,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As of someone gently rapping, rapping at your chamber door."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"'Tis some visitor,\" you muttered, \"tapping at my chamber door —"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Only this and nothing more.\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-724230560357585f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ah, do you distinctly remember the dew-doused window pane;"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And a dying baby dove laid like a shadow upon the floor."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Eagerly you had wished the story to meet a happy end"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Eagerly you had wished no birds would plummet, their demise to bewail."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Some soared like shining stars, bound for the sky..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "While others found only demise, in dust they lie."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7975a4ba7997f851"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Deep into that darkness peering, long you stood there wondering, fearing,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Doubting, dreaming dreams no mortal ever dared to dream before;"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Worms have stained satin, and flames consumed doves with broken wings,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A flame-bathed raven greeted you, its voice's rasp that sings."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Sweet dreams are no paradise of mine,\" you whispered and sighed. \"When I cast my eyes around —\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Darkness there and nothing more."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-84a8bb03a2bdf97e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Then this ebony bird beguiling your sad fancy into smiling,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"The echoes of ghosts bring no salvation to light.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"People repent, their hearts sincere, only due to them seeking greater gains.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Drink this blessed potion from the Great One, erasing your painful memories.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As Harmony's tune changed, you hear a dirge played amidst the dancing ashes..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Quoth the Raven \"Nevermore.\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-62ce68d445e22633"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The unbroken stillness remains silently, mocking any reply so aptly spoken,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But the Raven still beguiling all my fancy into smiling,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This and more I sat divining, scrying the source of the world's pain"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your heart grew resolute, no longer held back by confusion and doubt."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Liar,\" you declared, \"the Great One is blind to worldly sorrow —\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Merely this and nothing more."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b1c6dcc3f6ef2f3f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You ascended the stage, you stole the authority, you strived for divinity"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You raised the dim curtain, your self-directed farce skillfully honed."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your heart overflew with pureness, while the shadows of the puppets cast grim shadows in their play."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your soul embraced compassion, daring to forge a scale that will never sway."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Behold,\" you proclaimed, \"the utopia of absolute bliss,\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yet the dream shattered, \"Nevermore.\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b7fb24a890e391b9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The velvet nest fell, the golden bed withered away,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But the bird remained perched, as did you, come what may."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The gods, who once bestowed upon you love's sweet hue,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Withdrew their favor, leaving your paradise askew."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Liberated from the shadow of young dove's demise, your soul will take flight,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Merely this and nothing more."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-bc8c31740a563aed"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your old dreams are as dead soil, barren of hope and bereft,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yet how can a noble soul wither and fade, left adrift?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I shall await your arrival, with open arms and boundless hope,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Here lie the truest dreams, where infinite possibilities lope."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Here, all your ambitions shall be fulfilled and set aflame,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The past forever transformed, and nevermore"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e9052860bbd6a1aa"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "''"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Yours, Most Sincerely"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "''"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-33e6cd037646c944"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Cecil Simmes"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b2f0f78ca0f8ca60"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
